ClrHome

// Fill the screen one pixel at a time using nested loops
// This demonstrates graphics operations and loop constructs
// Now with color cycling through all 256 colors!

For X = 0 To 255
  For Y = 0 To 255
    // Cycle through all 256 colors based on pixel position
    COLOR_VAL = (X + Y) MOD 256
    PxlOn(Y, X, COLOR_VAL)
  Next Y
Next X

// Display completion message
Disp "SCREEN FILLED WITH COLORS!"